    "short_description": "Hyperactive 2D action platformer with wicked fast attacks, omnidirectional dashing, and time-freezing! Play well enough to transform and unleash 100% power!",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cIt\u2019s difficult to explicitly describe just how innately cathartic Advent Neon is to control; movement is impressively tight and responsive no matter how swift your running speed becomes. There\u2019s a fluidity here that truly has to be experienced to be believed, and the overall design expertly complements Neon\u2019s capabilities.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Noisy Pixel<br>",
